#: a160799bc0214e5dab0fd5979f08a29f
msgid "Memory optimization"
msgstr "内存优化"

#: 53dcbbf4fcd4463b9dd32faaf6991a80
msgid ""
"Use the memory profiler to identify large live tensors before enabling "
"swapping. Swapping lowers the minimum device-memory requirement, but it "
"cannot replace fixing an accidentally retained graph."
msgstr "启用交换前，先使用内存分析器定位占用较大的存活张量。交换可以降低最低设备内存需求，但不能替代对意外保留计算图的修复。"

#: 5b98f4c311594b2db1943a4446ecf3c7
msgid "Profile large allocations"
msgstr "分析大内存分配"

#: a419a42ffbe840018c2c32cb015d1472
msgid "The memory profiler attributes peak allocations to Python call sites:"
msgstr "内存分析器会把峰值分配归因到对应的 Python 调用位置："

#: 16e9e6a5eef14fe1bb3082b2534ca888
msgid ""
"Inspect the largest branches in the reported tree. Reduce temporary tensor "
"sizes, release Python references that keep graphs alive, or split work into "
"smaller batches before changing global memory limits."
msgstr "检查报告树中占用最大的分支。应先缩小临时张量、释放会保留计算图的 Python 引用，或把工作拆成更小的批次，再考虑修改全局内存限制。"

#: 38b00021fd034909a4074ec4d4fd92f5
msgid "Enable automatic swapping"
msgstr "启用自动交换"

#: f50765bb85104e9981416e382cfb2763
msgid ""
"Jittor can move values between device memory, host memory, and disk when a "
"limit is reached. Limits are bytes; `-1` means unlimited."
msgstr "达到限制时，计图可以在设备内存、主机内存和磁盘之间移动变量。限制值的单位是字节；`-1` 表示不限制。"

#: a580c6331b9f4791b7ce735516ba89a3
msgid ""
"PowerShell uses the corresponding `$env:JT_SAVE_MEM`, `$env:cpu_mem_limit`, "
"and `$env:device_mem_limit` variables. Keep swap storage on a local disk "
"with enough free space and expect lower throughput while swapping is active."
msgstr ""
"PowerShell 使用对应的 `$env:JT_SAVE_MEM`、`$env:cpu_mem_limit` 和 "
"`$env:device_mem_limit` 变量。交换目录应位于空间充足的本地磁盘；启用交换后吞吐量会降低。"

#: e3b007b8a2a54cfbba60fef24e51e1bb
msgid "Remove stale swap files with:"
msgstr "使用以下命令删除过期交换文件："
